n        }, _callee2, null, [[1, 3]]);\n      }))();\n    },\n    stopRecording: function stopRecording() {\n      if (this.mediaRecorder && this.isRecording) {\n        this.mediaRecorder.stop();\n        this.isRecording = false;\n      }\n    },\n    sendAudioToWhisper: function sendAudioToWhisper() {\n      var _this2 = this;\n      return _asyncToGenerator(/*#__PURE__*/_regenerator().m(function _callee3() {\n        var blob, formData, res, data, _t2;\n        return _regenerator().w(function (_context3) {\n          while (1) switch (_context3.p = _context3.n) {\n            case 0:\n              if (!(_this2.audioChunks.length === 0)) {\n                _context3.n = 1;\n                break;\n              }\n              return _context3.a(2);\n            case 1:\n              _this2.isTranscribing = true;\n              _context3.p = 2;\n              blob = new Blob(_this2.audioChunks, {\n                type: 'audio/webm'\n              });\n              formData = new FormData();\n              formData.append('audio', blob, 'recording.webm');\n              _context3.n = 3;\n              return fetch('http://localhost:5000/api/transcribe', {\n                method: 'POST',\n                body: formData\n              });\n            case 3:\n              res = _context3.v;\n              _context3.n = 4;\n              return res.json();\n            case 4:\n              data = _context3.v;\n              if (data.text) {\n                _this2.inputText = data.text;\n                _this2.lastWasVoice = true;\n                // 가상의 신뢰도 점수 (실제로는 Whisper API의 logprob 등을 활용 가능)\n                _this2.lastConfidence = Math.floor(Math.random() * 20) + 80;\n                _this2.sendMessage();\n              }\n              _context3.n = 6;\n              break;\n            case 5:\n              _context3.p = 5;\n              _t2 = _context3.v;\n              console.error('Whisper 에러:', _t2);\n            case 6:\n              _cont